%%{init: { 'theme': 'base', 'themeVariables': { 'fontFamily': 'Arial, sans-serif', 'fontSize': '14px', 'primaryColor': '#F3F4F6', 'primaryTextColor': '#111827', 'lineColor': '#374151', 'edgeLabelBackground': '#FFFFFF', 'actorLineColor': '#111827', 'actorTextColor': '#111827' }}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User Browser
    participant FE as Next.js Frontend
    participant API as FastAPI Routes
    participant CS as ConversionService
    participant SS as SimulationService
    participant QB as QSim Backend

    %% --- PHASE 1: CIRCUIT CONVERSION ---
    Note over User, CS: Phase 1: Circuit Conversion & Transpilation
    User->>FE: Select Framework & Click "Convert"
    FE->>API: POST /api/converter/convert
    activate API
    API->>CS: convert_to_qasm(code, framework)
    activate CS
    CS->>CS: Transpile & Extract Stats
    CS-->>API: Return QASM + Stats
    deactivate CS
    API-->>FE: JSON {qasm_code, stats}
    deactivate API
    FE-->>User: Render QASM View & Metrics

    %% --- PHASE 2: SIMULATION EXECUTION ---
    Note over User, QB: Phase 2: Quantum Simulation Execution
    User->>FE: Select Backend & Click "Run"
    FE->>API: POST /api/simulator/execute-qsim
    activate API
    API->>SS: execute_qasm_with_qsim(qasm)
    activate SS
    SS->>QB: Initialize & Load Circuit
    activate QB
    QB->>QB: Run Quantum Simulation
    QB-->>SS: Raw Counts & Metadata
    deactivate QB
    SS-->>API: Processed Results
    deactivate SS
    API-->>FE: JSON {results}
    deactivate API
    FE-->>User: Render Histogram & Probability Distribution